# DRAPE — Brand Identity System

**Version 1.0 — June 2026**
**Tagline:** Wear what you mean.

---

## Brand Essence

Drape exists at the intersection of personal style and intelligent technology. The brand makes personal shopping accessible to Gen Z fast fashion consumers by embedding an AI stylist inside retailer apps they already use.

The identity draws from the visual language of contemporary luxury (Jacquemus, The Row, Lemaire) but deliberately strips back exclusivity. The goal is warmth without pretension, taste without gatekeeping.

