## UI Components

### Cards
- Background: Warm white (#FAF8F5) or Cream (#F5F0E8)
- Border: 0.5px solid Sand (#E8DED0)
- Border radius: 12px
- Padding: 16px to 20px
- No drop shadows. Depth is created through background colour separation, not elevation.

### Buttons

| Type | Background | Text | Border |
|------|-----------|------|--------|
| Primary CTA | Muted gold #C4A265 | Rich black #1A1714 | None |
| Secondary | Transparent | Rich black #1A1714 | 0.5px solid #E8DED0 |
| Ghost | Transparent | Warm stone #8A7D6B | None |

- Border radius on all buttons: 8px
- Height: 44px minimum (touch target)
- Text: 13px, 500 weight, 0.04em tracking, uppercase

### Input fields
- Background: Warm white (#FAF8F5)
- Border: 0.5px solid Sand (#E8DED0), Muted gold on focus
- Border radius: 8px
- Height: 44px
- Placeholder text: Mist (#D4D0C8)

### Tags and pills
- Background: Sand (#E8DED0)
- Text: Warm stone (#8A7D6B), 12px, 500 weight
- Border radius: 20px (full pill)
- Padding: 4px 12px
- Active state: Gold background, Rich black text

### Navigation bar
- Background: Warm white (#FAF8F5)
- Active icon/label: Muted gold (#C4A265)
- Inactive icon/label: Warm stone (#8A7D6B)
- Icon size: 24px
- Label: 10px, 400 weight

