## Layout Principles

### Spacing scale
- 4px — tight internal padding
- 8px — default gap between inline elements
- 12px — gap within card content
- 16px — card padding, section gaps
- 24px — between card groups
- 32px — major section breaks
- 48px — page-level vertical rhythm

### Grid
- Mobile: single column, 16px side margins
- Tablet: 2 columns, 20px gutter
- Desktop: 3 or 4 columns, 24px gutter
- Max content width: 1200px, centred

### Negative space
- Treat white space as a design element, not leftover. The brand breathes.
- Product grids should have equal vertical and horizontal gutters.
- Never stack more than three content blocks without a visual break (divider, spacing, or colour change).

