## Brand Application

### App icon
- Monogram "D" in Pinyon Script on Rich black (#1A1714) background
- No border radius override, use system default
- Gold (#C4A265) letterform on black, or black letterform on warm white

### Social media
- Profile picture: Pinyon Script monogram on black
- Post style: single product image with generous warm white border, editorial caption underneath
- Grid rhythm: alternate between outfit photography and typographic quotes in Cormorant Garamond on cream backgrounds

### Pitch decks
- Use the Pinyon Script wordmark on title slides
- Section headers in Cormorant Garamond, 300 weight
- Body text in Inter or system sans
- Background: Warm white. Use Rich black for section divider slides only.
- Gold as accent colour for data points, callouts, and CTA elements

